  "description": "A coming-of-age drama about a group of children who try to fulfill the wishes of an old friend from their childhood.\n\nHan So-hee believes in precognitive dreams, but the man of her dreams is someone else entirely.\n\nPlagued by bullying and unable to connect with her friends, Han So-hee gradually opens her mind to uncover truths that are very different from her dreams...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4421003629), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63165459), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10484197), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000061213), [Blice](https://www.blice.co.kr/web/detail.kt?novelId=72697)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/163428)",
